# Build context exclusions.
#
# Hugging Face Spaces builds from the git repo, so it never sees any of this —
# but a local `docker build .` copies the whole working tree, and `COPY . .`
# followed by `RUN rm -rf` cannot shrink the image: Docker layers are additive,
# so the copied bytes stay in the earlier layer and the removal only writes
# whiteout entries. Excluding them here is the only thing that actually keeps a
# laptop build the same size as the Spaces one (measured in this tree: 256 MB of
# .venv plus 354 MB of .git).
.venv/
venv/
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.wav
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.DS_Store
# Documentation and dev tooling: not imported by the running app.
docs/
scripts/
